          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji werekoghe wikighenda, na kuvika kutua kwa muzi, Samueli ukamzera Sauli, “Mzere mdumiki wako ukirie.” Nao uja mdumiki ukaida ukakiria. Niko Samueli ukaghamba, “Dunga maghu kutini nikughorie ilagho ja Mlungu.”",
          "type": "text",
